# This workspace is a scratch arena, not a source tree.
#
# It holds multi-GB tool caches (node_modules, .pnpm-store, __pycache__), browser
# profiles with saved credentials and cookies (.amz-audit, .chrome-scrape),
# business documents (选品表*, 渠道清单), and build artifacts.
#
# Track ONLY the repo-config skeleton, so that a careless `git add -A` can never
# publish any of the above. Add new tracked files by un-ignoring them here.
*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/docs/
!/docs/agents/
!/docs/agents/*.md